{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_1000_p", "source_sha256": "99b88606bedd69e20d697dc525551484884ac8865f3cab3ece3402e0815abcf8", "ja": "（仕事が一段落したので、休憩を取る事にした。\nふぅ……毎日、なんだかんだあるな……）", "zh": "（工作告一段落后，决定休息一下。呼……每天总会有这样那样的事啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_1001_101kot", "source_sha256": "d2b74b977e9aa3a3f25ba65a632d47b86bc52e52b2fbba978563e03ee38fde25", "ja": "{$P$}さん、こんにちは。\n今はお休み中ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你好呀。\n现在正在休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d532dbf6f32f60a30900458126dd5e719b02877f50fd314153e7e2d2473c2458", "ja": "あれっ？　音無さん、お疲れさまです。\nええ、休憩中ですが……どうして劇場に？", "zh": "哎？音无小姐，辛苦了。\n是的，我现在在休息……怎么来剧场了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "44808b012848a28c148659988321b8282197ffbfd888951c68a650fd2931bd4b", "ja": "社長とお仕事で近くまで来たので、\nついでに、おみやげを届けに来ました。どうぞ♪", "zh": "我和社长来附近办事，\n顺便过来给你们带了点伴手礼。请收下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_1004", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6784b8299951f029848b99dcd7821c99144789ca3622e13a80f5d6e4cd8ea755", "ja": "おっ、これはわざわざありがとうございます。\n……ん？　あれ……？", "zh": "哦，居然特意送来这个，真是谢谢了。\n……嗯？奇怪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "e4151a4514cbc94827c83b6c9c9848baa2233d221532a3f18d862880ca5bf4c4", "ja": "？　どうかしました？", "zh": "？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2002_p", "source_sha256": "3ae7f5307d346a834d03c2b59c6ccee60df62b4b8caea96f579cc520cb8c1807", "ja": "いや、なんだか……今日は音無さんが、\nいつもと少し違って見えるような……どうしてかな？", "zh": "没，总觉得……音无女士今天看起来\n好像和往常有点不一样……为什么会这样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "063e66587c2122dcc6087d1d71be0c84875ede74c5df013ea57c1dd3d9ac54e1", "ja": "はっ！？　{$P$}さんったら……\n私がメイクを変えたことに、すぐ気づくなんて……！？", "zh": "啊！？{$P$}先生真是的……\n居然马上就注意到我换了妆……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2004_p", "source_sha256": "dedb2f65232a3986c787205c734109aed8601f9b4985a205d097fe020b49009f", "ja": "あ、そうか、制服だ。\nそれ、昔のですね？", "zh": "啊，原来是制服。\n那是以前的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2005_101kot", "source_sha256": "90acdc3cd06f1ff2fc82c241caf9f29d6c18d8573f1c0a2b755de3478fb7b514", "ja": "あ、そっち……コホン、そうですね。\n今日は劇場ができる前の制服です。", "zh": "啊，是那件……咳咳，没错。\n这是剧场成立前穿的制服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2006_101kot", "source_sha256": "1ab177306eaad54198c667f81931ddab462ee803a46135120cd11ee3a84d0d8f", "ja": "今でもたまに着てるんですよ？　劇場でのお仕事じゃ\nなくて、他の事務所さんとご一緒するときとか♪", "zh": "现在偶尔也会穿哦？不是在剧场工作的时候，而是和其他事务所一起工作时♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2007_p", "source_sha256": "25345af1a2d521d100fbb05bc31ee1aeca659d7c5b0e6570b4f368c8ebe66c68", "ja": "そういえば、そうでしたね。\nでも劇場で見るのは、なんだか新鮮だなって。", "zh": "说起来，确实是这样呢。不过在剧场看到，感觉还是挺新鲜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2008_101kot", "source_sha256": "9d94b3ea60ececdfc391324be27146e94bebd23dc43ae0255f278c9349de5ef0", "ja": "ふふっ、今はそうかもしれませんね。\n私もこの制服に袖を通すと、ちょっとそう思います。", "zh": "呵呵，现在或许确实是这样呢。\n我穿上这身制服时，也会有点这么觉得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2009_101kot", "source_sha256": "5e366bed7cc635137e02849bb813947d340cf9a3dd596e6e88ad1b1786d83052", "ja": "また新しいことが始まる予感と言うか……。\n初心を思い出すのかもしれません。", "zh": "总觉得又有新的事情要开始了……  \n也许是想起了最初的心情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2010_101kot", "source_sha256": "dd6a48d4622fa9b21e7364df95822f58300a22b7555077ed6ac4218d8f2875ad", "ja": "最初は私ひとりで……。事務仕事に社長の付き添い、\nライブの影ナレ、オーディションの手配……。ううう。", "zh": "最开始只有我一个人……。处理文书工作、陪同社长，\n演唱会的幕后旁白、试镜的安排……。呜呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2011_p", "source_sha256": "637b7fcdd5695ea660b8a47a6dd5e33a902cdd6e4e83b53b1f1a3ca4dcdb1147", "ja": "お、音無さん？　初心というか、\nトラウマが蘇ってませんか？　大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "音、音无小姐？与其说是初心未泯，您这是想起心理阴影了吧？没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2012_101kot", "source_sha256": "d63195e77b91a4ad67fd99c69090df425d8f6cb794371044447e80e1258b376e", "ja": "あ、はい、大丈夫です！　ちょっと変な方向の\n思い出ばかり浮かんで来ただけですから。うふふ♪", "zh": "啊，嗯，没事的！只是脑海里一个劲儿地浮现出一些有点奇怪的回忆而已。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2013_101kot", "source_sha256": "a4ef65e92710d9019077f65cc20cd6b3cdc187439d6b40a614b0049b536dec8e", "ja": "それに、忙しいのはいいことですよね！　この制服で\n頑張って、新しい出会いがあって、それから今の……。", "zh": "而且，忙碌也是好事嘛！穿着这身制服努力，就能遇到新的邂逅，然后还有现在的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2014_101kot", "source_sha256": "1f8797982e7dfad44b68b6c5d77419ddb0d9f65f5b0f2d3a576acb76697e2454", "ja": "この劇場があるんですから♪", "zh": "因为还有这座剧场在嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2015_p", "source_sha256": "401a1b5bf7d77237412952706321882c85ff4044aca085694f5e632f5e103649", "ja": "音無さん……。", "zh": "音无小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2016_101kot", "source_sha256": "2e6151f52452d68a7d59f4787b8bf7a5f6626b2092ae22f63990460a33920679", "ja": "うふふ、というわけで！\n今までも、たくさんお世話になりましたけど……。", "zh": "嘻嘻，所以说！\n一直以来都承蒙您多方关照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_101kot0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_101kot0013_2017_101kot", "source_sha256": "f517c82545accff39d5b41dcfa8ccae8512de4e7bf574c7843f05a492111b5a0", "ja": "これからも、よろしくお願いしますね！\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "今后也请多多关照哦！\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
